<title>USA: Cypress Financial hires Arthur Andersen.</title>
<headline>Cypress Financial hires Arthur Andersen.</headline>
<dateline>CYPRESS, Calif. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cypress Financial Services Inc on Tuesday said it has hired Arthur Andersen LLP as its independent public accountants in conjunction with its future growth plans.</p>
<p>Arthur Andersen was selected due to its recognized national stature in performing accounting services for publicly traded corporations, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Cypress Financial Services is a diversified accounts receivable and debt recovery services company with operations in the United States and Japan.</p>
</text>
